Z||000018||fogglethorpe||10-15-2001||06:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pontiaddict:<BR><B>There's no way to repair them, you have to replace the whole sha-bang. May I suggest that you upgrade to the newer one, but not the newest because they started getting cheap when making them in the past few months.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I see what you mean. I went to The Watchamacallit Outlet, and looked around. They seem to be all plastic now. The doodads have plastic tappets instead of screws, and the whattheheck flexes too much when the whateveritis spins.<P>||||reg||1
