Z||000020||fogglethorpe||10-16-2001||10:25 PM||||Well, I decided to stop flogging a dead horse. I went to Whatchamacallits-R-Us, and forked over the greenbacks for a new one. It's top of the line, baby! It's the Deluxe, Limited Edition 420s Super Model. Among the features:<BR>-Dual limited slip pivot inhibitors<BR>-Inlay trays with safety glaze<BR>-Triple-lipped drip grip<BR>-Aluminum tubular boom<BR>-Hyper-kinetic eccentrics<BR>-Double layered goo seals, with rust retardant dust covers<BR>-Reversing universal swervers<P>It cost a pretty penny, but worth it.||||reg||1
